   "source": [
    "### Heater-area screening\n",
    "\n",
    "The same $Q=UA\\Delta T_{lm}$ relation is applied to the rich-gas and oil heaters. For heaters, the\n",
    "hot-medium inlet is paired with the cold-process outlet, and the hot-medium outlet with the\n",
    "cold-process inlet. This corrects the original ambiguous sign convention while retaining the\n",
    "same physical duty and area.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
