   "source": [
    "## Q5 â€” Gas-scrubber diameter screening\n",
    "\n",
    "Estimate minimum internal diameters with a Soudersâ€“Brown-style gas-load factor of 0.1 m/s. These\n",
    "are hydraulic screening values; a design must also address droplet size, internals, liquid surge,\n",
    "level control, nozzles, and code margins.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "pUmGXnymT5hg"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "gas_load_factor = 0.1\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "iq5V3laBOi_T"
   },
   "source": [
    "The dew-point scrubber has negligible liquid in the converged normal case. A screening liquid\n",
    "density of 600 kg/mÂ³ is therefore used only to establish a notional gas-capacity diameter. It is\n",
    "not evidence of a liquid inventory at normal operation.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "cA5yh9UATVuM",
    "outputId": "7de757af-d621-408a-8c60-d54f1bbc17bc"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "gas density  67.355  [kg/mÂ³]\n",
      "Liquid density  600.0  [kg/m3]\n",
      "Maximum gas velocity  0.281  [m/sec]\n",
      "Minimum scrubber internal diameter  5.882  [m]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Dew point scrubber\n",
    "flowRate = dewPointScrubber.getGasOutStream().getFlowRate(\"m3/sec\")\n",
    "gas_density = dewPointScrubber.getGasOutStream().getFluid().getPhase(\"gas\").getDensity(\"kg/m3\")\n",
    "liquid_density = 600.0\n",
    "\n",
    "V_t = gas_load_factor * math.sqrt((liquid_density - gas_density) / gas_density)\n",
    "\n",
    "A_scrub = flowRate / V_t\n",
    "\n",
    "D_scrub = math.sqrt(A_scrub / (3.14 / 4.0))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"gas density \", round(gas_density, 3), \" [kg/mÂ³]\")\n",
    "print(\"Liquid density \", round(liquid_density, 3), \" [kg/m3]\")\n",
    "print(\"Maximum gas velocity \", round(V_t, 3), \" [m/sec]\")\n",
    "print(\"Minimum scrubber internal diameter \", round(D_scrub, 3), \" [m]\")\n"
   ]
  },
