    "## Q6 â€” TEG purity requirement\n",
    "\n",
    "Relate the specified âˆ’10 Â°C water dew point to a lean-TEG purity target. The 97 wt% value below is\n",
    "an assignment/design-chart assumption. A rigorous absorber and regenerator calculation would\n",
    "also require gasâ€“glycol equilibrium, circulation rate, stages, pressure, temperature, and losses.\n"
   ]
  },
