    "id": "cKY4AhhmV9C-"
   },
   "source": [
    "For the supplied design chart, a âˆ’10 Â°C water-dew-point target requires at least 97 wt% lean TEG.\n",
    "The component splitter used above removes water ideally and therefore must not be interpreted as\n",
    "a prediction that 97 wt% TEG will achieve the target for every absorber design.\n"
   ]
